r/id #uuid "6422d259-4780-583b-94bd-0f309546c5e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }_{1,2}=\\pm \\sqrt{28}\\,\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-319a7b2a-cd1e-5b76-9ec8-6d532f431849" :answer/id #uuid "319a7b2a-cd1e-5b76-9ec8-6d532f431849" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${\\lambda }_{1}=-4$ and ${\\lambda }_{2}=7$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-70f15ca0-16c9-5d5a-908a-ee232a3e10a1" :answer/id #uuid "70f15ca0-16c9-5d5a-908a-ee232a3e10a1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${\\lambda }_{1}=3$ and ${\\lambda }_{2}=5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1431c518-0720-5741-b2e4-d9808709c654" :answer-field/id #uuid "1431c518-0720-5741-b2e4-d9808709c654" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-dab3322e-8c73-5c38-ac04-a9b67a39acfd" :answer-field/choices ["answer-810c1ce2-2836-5f5b-8d80-bf8c755c3ea9" "answer-5dbff882-e5e6-5756-a325-fd54b19a41e7" "answer-dab3322e-8c73-5c38-ac04-a9b67a39acfd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-810c1ce2-2836-5f5b-8d80-bf8c755c3ea9" :answer/id #uuid "810c1ce2-2836-5f5b-8d80-bf8c755c3ea9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "a stable" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5dbff882-e5e6-5756-a325-fd54b19a41e7" :answer/id #uuid "5dbff882-e5e6-5756-a325-fd54b19a41e7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "an asymptotically stable" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dab3322e-8c73-5c38-ac04-a9b67a39acfd" :answer/id #uuid "dab3322e-8c73-5c38-ac04-a9b67a39acfd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "an unstable" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b58ed4e5-6c54-5acb-ad76-d1a197c4b886" :answer-field/id #uuid "b58ed4e5-6c54-5acb-ad76-d1a197c4b886" :answer-field/key "field-7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-a36899be-589f-5db6-9827-5f3474adb012" :answer-field/choices ["answer-60e5a9ac-748a-53b2-8a1b-542eed038f4e" "answer-a36899be-589f-5db6-9827-5f3474adb012" "answer-8ef2527e-7ac4-50b8-8a8f-166b4d791622" "answer-b324e632-6666-52ca-8f4a-c375acc3854a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-60e5a9ac-748a-53b2-8a1b-542eed038f4e" :answer/id #uuid "60e5a9ac-748a-53b2-8a1b-542eed038f4e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "center" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a36899be-589f-5db6-9827-5f3474adb012" :answer/id #uuid "a36899be-589f-5db6-9827-5f3474adb012" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "saddle" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8ef2527e-7ac4-50b8-8a8f-166b4d791622" :answer/id #uuid "8ef2527e-7ac4-50b8-8a8f-166b4d791622" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "spiral sink" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b324e632-6666-52ca-8f4a-c375acc3854a" :answer/id #uuid "b324e632-6666-52ca-8f4a-c375acc3854a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "spiral source" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-3850fcb7-fc55-55b2-8f9f-750fe16ba10c" :question/id #uuid "3850fcb7-fc55-55b2-8f9f-750fe16ba10c" :question/math-academy-id "q-335012" :question/problem "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}=0.8x-0.4xy \\\\ {y}^{′}=-0.3y+1.2xy\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the Lotka-Volterra model above, where $x=x(t)$ represents the prey and $y=y(t)$ represents the predators. Select the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\n$\\,$ Evaluating the Jacobian of the system at the equilibrium ${x}^{∗}=[0.25,\\,2]^{T},$ we get\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">$J({x}^{∗})=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,.$</td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-4}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n$\\,$ The eigenvalues of the Jacobian matrix are \n{{field-5}}.\n\n$\\,$ Therefore, the equilibrium at ${x}^{∗}$ is\n{{field-6}}{{field-7}}." :question/worked-solution "Let's denote ${f}_{1}(x,y)=0.8x-0.4xy$ and ${f}_{2}(x,y)=-0.3y+1.2xy.$\n\nNow, we compute the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂{f}_{1}}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(0.8x-0.4xy)=0.8-0.4y,\\, & \\frac{∂{f}_{1}}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(0.8x-0.4xy)=-0.4x \\\\ \\frac{∂{f}_{2}}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(-0.3y+1.2xy)=1.2y,\\, & \\frac{∂{f}_{2}}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(-0.3y+1.2xy)=-0.3+1.2x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the Jacobian matrix is\n\n$$\nJ=[\\begin{aligned}0.8-0.4y & -0.4x \\\\ 1.2y & -0.3+1.2x\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the Jacobian at the equilibrium ${x}^{∗}=[\\begin{aligned}0.25 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ to get\n\n$$\nJ({x}^{∗})=[\\begin{aligned}0.8-0.4(2) & -0.4(0.25) \\\\ 1.2(2) & -0.3+1.2(0.25)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -0.1 \\\\ 2.4 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the eigenvalues of the Jacobian matrix, we write down the characteristic equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}-\\lambda  & -0.1 \\\\ 2.4 & -\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-\\lambda )(-\\lambda )-2.4\\cdot (-0.1) & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+0.24 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving the equation, we get the eigenvalues ${\\lambda }_{1,2}=\\pm 0.2\\sqrt{6}\\,\\text{i}.$ Since the eigenvalues are purely imaginary, our equilibrium is $\\text{a stable}$ $\\text{center}.$\n\n**Note:**\nFor the Lotka-Volterra model (as in this problem), it is safe to classify the nonzero equilibrium as a center when the linearization has purely imaginary eigenvalues. \n\n**Watch out!** \nIn contrast, for a general nonlinear system, the Jacobian test alone is inconclusive (additional analysis is required to determine whether the equilibrium is a true center or a spiral sink/source)." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9af73619-6029-51e0-973e-e0cc16bba1eb" "answer-field-b0cdbe5f-be3e-576b-a6f3-c613a26e6a75" "answer-field-10eecd73-7ddb-53e1-8cee-ba9cc82a6721" "answer-field-501eccdf-0e11-55e1-a87a-775b0d4b38ae" "answer-field-50f34f5b-fdcb-50ec-a49e-61db5d87a1e4" "answer-field-a03f641b-55a6-5ab2-9892-aba7070b3f94" "answer-field-7c735b62-1fdc-51f8-bd8e-81ae9ffcfbf7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9af73619-6029-51e0-973e-e0cc16bba1eb" :answer-field/id #uuid "9af73619-6029-51e0-973e-e0cc16bba1eb" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-5624957c-5e11-5eb7-8bf4-56a63fae6d1f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-45dd6cd2-c849-5754-9638-394bb39434bc" "answer-6d31fe48-be9a-51ef-ae21-7514877826db" "answer-5624957c-5e11-5eb7-8bf4-56a63fae6d1f" "answer-0e288ead-1776-55f7-834f-4d1fb8f43f66" "answer-64fdfb23-1249-56f1-973c-fdf15c799537"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-45dd6cd2-c849-5754-9638-394bb39434bc" :answer/id #uuid "45dd6cd2-c849-5754-9638-394bb39434bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-0.1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6d31fe48-be9a-51ef-ae21-7514877826db" :answer/id #uuid "6d31fe48-be9a-51ef-ae21-7514877826db" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-0.3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5624957c-5e11-5eb7-8bf4-56a63fae6d1f" :answer/id #uuid "5624957c-5e11-5eb7-8bf4-56a63fae6d1f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0e288ead-1776-55f7-834f-4d1fb8f43f66" :answer/id #uuid "0e288ead-1776-55f7-834f-4d1fb8f43f66" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-64fdfb23-1249-56f1-973c-fdf15c799537" :answer/id #uuid "64fdfb23-1249-56f1-973c-fdf15c799537" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2.4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "a